ISORS UNDER 40 YEARS OF AGE ACROSS THE COUNTRY BASED ON SEVERAL FACTORS INCLUDING SUCCESS IN THE BUSINESS, COMPLIANCE RECORDS, ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT AND HIGH LEVELS OF ETHICAL STANDARDS. “CONGRATULATIONS TO THE TALENTED ADVISORS ON THIS LIST WHO REPRESE'}{'symbol': 'AMAT', 'date': '2021-10-01 08:30:00', 'title': 'APPLIED MATERIALS ANNOUNCES EXECUTIVE CHANGE', 'text': 'BOB HALLIDAY APPOINTED INTERIM CFO BOB HALLIDAY APPOINTED INTERIM CFO'}{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2021-10-01 10:15:00', 'title': "AT&T GIVES BUSINESS 'PLAIN-OLD' PHONE SERVICE A CLOUD MAKEOVER", 'text': "DALLAS, OCT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WHAT'S THE NEWS?\xa0AT&T IS MODERNIZING BUSINESS' TRADITIONAL ANALOG PHONE LINES USING THE CLOUD."}{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2021-10-01 08:28:00', 'title': 'AKASTOR ASA AND BAKER HUGHES COMPLETE MERGER BETWEEN MHWIRTH AND SDS', 'text': "OSLO, NORWAY, OCT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REFERENCE IS MADE TO THE JOINT PRESS ANNOUNCEMENT DATED 2 MARCH 2021 FROM BAKER HUGHES (NYSE: BKR) AND AKASTOR ASA (OSLO: AKAST). THE PARTIES HAVE TODAY COMPLETED THE TRANSACTION THAT COMBINES THE OPERATIONS OF BAKER HUGHES' SUBSEA DRILLING SYSTEMS (SDS) BUSINESS WITH AKASTOR'S WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY, MHWIRTH AS (MHWIRTH) IN LINE WITH THE TERMS AND CONDITIONS DESCRIBED IN THE EARLIER ANNOUNCEMENT."}{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2021-10-01 08:17:00', 'title': 'AKASTOR ASA COMPLETES REFINANCING OF ITS CORPORATE CREDIT FACILITY', 'text': 'OSLO, NORWAY, OCT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REFERENCE IS MADE TO THE JOINT PRESS ANNOUNCEMENT DATED 2 MARCH 2021 FROM BAKER HUGHES (NYSE: BKR) AND AKASTOR ASA (OSLO: AKAST). SIMULTANEOUS WITH THE COMPLETION OF THE TRANSACTION AS ANNOUNCED PER SEPARATE PRESS RELEASE, AKASTOR HAS TODAY COMPLETED A REFINANCING OF ITS EXISTING REVOLVING CORPORATE CREDIT FACILITY.'}{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2021-10-01 08:03:00', 'title': "BAKER HUGHES' SUBSEA DRILLING SYSTEMS AND AKASTOR'S MHWIRTH COMPLETE MERGER TO FORM HMH", 'text': "HOUSTON & FORNEBU, NORWAY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--